  "description": "Powerful LINQ to Gremlin query provider for Stardust.Paradox graph database framework. Write natural C# LINQ queries that are automatically translated to efficient Gremlin traversals for CosmosDB, Apache TinkerPop, and other Gremlin-compatible graph databases. Features include full LINQ support (Where, Select, OrderBy, GroupBy, aggregations), type-safe graph traversals (Out, In, OutE, InE), lambda expressions, pattern matching, set operations, and async/await support. Perfect for Entity Framework-style graph database development with IntelliSense and compile-time checking.",
